  <Key>UNMATCHEDDESTINY</Key>
  <Name>Unmatched Destiny</Name>
  <Description>The most powerful Mystics have an unmatched mastery of the Force. Their connection is so deep and so instinctive that they can call upon it at will. However, this powerful connection has a cost, and these Mystics risk opening themselves to the dark side of the Force.
[P]Once per game session, after making a Force power check, the character may spend 2 Destiny Points to reroll up to 2 Force dice. Conflict generated as part of this Force power check is doubled.</Description>
